{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6158","title":"POCO Unveils POCO C81 Pro: Bigger Screen, Longer Battery Life, Smarter Everyday Experience","desc":"POCO, a leading brand among young technology enthusiasts, today launched POCO C81 Pro, featuring an immersive 6.9-inch display and a massive 6000mAh (typ) battery.","view_cnt":"1560","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1776753483","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/316_operatorx_operatorx_opx/21/04/2026/4d1d03931ab0aafbc1d8f15e8d18e21f.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e[\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, April 24, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e] - POCO, a leading brand among young technology enthusiasts, today launched POCO C81 Pro, featuring an immersive 6.9-inch display and a massive 6000mAh (typ) battery.¹ As the first device in POCO C Series powered by Xiaomi HyperOS 3,² POCO C81 Pro delivers a reliable and seamless mobile experience built for everyday use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Sunlight Display Elevates Everyday Entertainment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO C81 Pro features a massive 6.9-inch display, promising an immersive experience for scrolling, browsing, and streaming. Supporting up to a 120Hz refresh rate³ and up to 800nits HBM brightness, POCO C81 Pro delivers smooth interactions and clear visibility even in bright outdoor environments. Wet Touch Technology 2.0 ensures responsive touch performance even when fingers are wet, oily, or soapy. Meanwhile, with triple TÜV Rheinland eye-care certifications, POCO C81 Pro helps improve eye comfort and reduce eye strain during prolonged screen use.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/232_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/04/2026/26a98c64df9a6ad8a59d175fc34c87e6.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Performance Powered by a Massive Battery\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePowered by a massive 6,000mAh (typ) battery,¹ POCO C81 Pro delivers more than two days of usage on a single charge.⁴ Engineered for long-term reliability, POCO C81 Pro retains consistent battery performance even after 1,000 charge cycles,⁵ ensuring extended battery life for everyday use.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/335_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/04/2026/690860ab4bf3213d0fcfe82c3abd574b.jpg\" alt=\"The internal structure of the phone is displayed, with the yellow battery occupying the main part, surrounded by other electronic components and interfaces. The overall presentation exudes a sense of technology and precision design.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eEquipped with a powerful octa-core processor, LPDDR4X + UFS 2.2 RAM and storage, POCO C81 Pro ensures smooth multitasking and quick app loading. With up to 8GB of RAM⁶ enabled via the Memory extension solution, users can enjoy a more responsive and seamless everyday experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRunning on Xiaomi HyperOS 3,² POCO C81 Pro also brings a range of smart features, including Google Gemini,⁷ Circle to Search,⁸ Xiaomi HyperIsland,⁹ and Xiaomi Interconnectivity,¹⁰ enabling quicker access to information and smoother interactions across devices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSlim Design with Distinctive Colorways\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eOn the back cover, POCO C81 Pro's design is elevated by a high-gloss camera ring that frames the lens module, adding a refined and sophisticated touch. The device is available in three colorways — Green, Gold, and Black — each offering a distinct visual identity. Beyond its stunning looks, the 8.15mm slim profile and 208g weight ensure a comfortable in-hand feel, making the device easy to hold and use even during extended periods.¹¹\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/464_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/04/2026/1f764f7619e7c015bbab47c2b286c4f7.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced Camera and Immersive Audio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO C81 Pro features a 13MP AI dual camera¹² system with a new, larger sensor that boosts light intake by 13%,¹³ enabling more vivid and true-to-life images. Paired with HDR mode, it delivers improved clarity and dynamic range across a variety of shooting scenes. On the front, the 8MP selfie camera with built-in beauty features helps capture natural-looking selfies with ease. Both front and rear cameras support Night mode, enabling brighter and clearer results in low-light environments.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eComplementing the visual experience, the device also supports up to 200% volume boost,¹⁴ delivering louder and more immersive audio for games, movies, and more.\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/120_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/04/2026/6cc5a166bc4628e7e7156bf051b34173.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO C81 Pro will be available in three colors: Green, Black, and Gold.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in three variants: 4GB + 64GB, 4GB + 128GB, and 4GB + 256GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions. You may consult third-party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ 6000mAh refers to the typical value of POCO C81 Pro's battery capacity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS features, apps, and services may vary depending on software version and product model.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ Refresh rate can be adjusted to up to 120Hz for supported apps.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ The DOU data is based on test results from POCO Internal Labs, measured under a simulated, comprehensive battery life scenario reflecting light daily use (including typical smartphone activities such as home screen use, calls, music playback, gaming, social media, email, maps, video streaming, camera, browser, standby, etc.) Actual results may vary due to differences in the testing environment, software version, network conditions, and individual usage patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁵ Data refers to the battery remaining at 80% or more capacity after 1,000 battery life cycles. Data tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁶ 4GB extended RAM is based on the 4GB RAM version. Creating additional RAM will occupy a selected amount of ROM storage on your device. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. Actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models. Configurations available may differ between different regions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁷ Results are for illustrative purposes only and may vary. Check responses. Set up required. Compatibility and availability vary. 18+. Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁸ Google and Android are trademarks of Google LLC. Available on select devices, and an internet connection is required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁹ Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Availability of specific features and services may vary depending on software version, apps, regions, and device models. Please refer to actual use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁰ Xiaomi Interconnectivity features may vary by software version, device model, and compatibility. Some features require logging into the same Xiaomi account, with Bluetooth, WLAN, NFC, and \"Settings-Interconnectivity\" enabled.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹¹ Data regarding dimensions and weight tested in POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹² The dual-camera system consists of one 13MP main camera and one auxiliary sensor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹³ Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs and compared to POCO C71.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁴ Data tested by POCO Internal Labs, 200% volume boost refers to 16 levels of volume compared to 15 levels, and actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios. Please refer to the actual use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"329","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1777017614"},"common":null}